<h1>Delete Gap and Flush</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">T</span><span lang="EN-US">he</span> <span lang="EN-US" class="Command">Delete Gap and Flush</span> <span lang="EN-US">command is accessible from the</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>context menu for Gap and Flush &gt; Delete Gap and Flush</b></i></span><span lang="EN-US">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span></b> <span lang="EN-US">This command deletes the current Gap and Flush dimension.</span></p>
<p class="bullet" style="font-weight:normal;"><b><span class="Command" style="font-weight:normal;">To delete all Gap and Flush dimensions in the scene</span></b> <b><span class="Command" style="font-weight:normal;">right-click on a Gap and Flush dimension value and from the context menu select</span> <span class="Command"><a href="delete_all_gap_and_flush.htm" style="font-weight:bold;">Delete All Gap and Flush</a></span> <span style="font-weight:normal;">command or</span></b> go to Measure menu and select the same command from there.</p>
